{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"notes\": {\n    \"甲\": \"甲版清楚串起了暂时安宁未能挽回失去、熟悉的亲切感照亮缺席、身体先于理解产生惊悸、愿望无处安放而持续盘旋的因果链，也说明鲜明的舞步不等于内心好转；但它对熟悉生活的联想如何具体加深失落解释得较为简略，且没有纳入182–197小节也可能是先前更具宣告性的波兰舞曲材料以不完整姿态重现这一备选理解。\",\n    \"乙\": \"乙版不仅解释了安宁为何突然转成惊惧、舞蹈性为何能重新激活感情却不能带来安定，还说明了越用力寻找着力点、越得不到确定，紧张便越深，身体也从向外冲转为僵住等待的反馈机制；不过，刚刚经历的幸福和已经知道温暖终将过去等前提比听感记录更确定，且同样没有展开182–197小节的材料身份备选解释。\"\n  },\n  \"verdict\": \"乙 版不差于 甲 版\",\n  \"why\": \"乙版的优势不在于篇幅或故事完整度，而在于更明确地解释了应对办法为何失效并反过来加深紧张、改变身体反应，尽管它对幸福经历和失去意识的部分前提有所超推，但这些局部风险不足以抵消其在因果机制上的解释增量。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "af6e6c45-592f-459d-a68c-5cfaf65c8f8b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T135019569760Z", "elapsed_seconds": 124.375, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T13:52:23.939653+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "0b51558e976febd56d4493f07d5d0c928597ce8d5d515bf382d5922a3f8db8ff", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8